        <div>
          <head n="1" source="#source-48174-48282"><seg source="#source-48174-48198">２　ほこりたかき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48198-48222"><rb>書生</rb><rt>しょせい</rt></ruby></head>
        </div>
