        <div>
          <head n="1" source="#source-116229-116343"><seg source="#source-116229-116235">３　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-116235-116259"><rb>西洋</rb><rt>せいよう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-116259-116262">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-116262-116277"><rb>旅</rb><rt>たび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-116277-116286">みやげ</seg></head>
        </div>
