      <div type="layout" source="#source-116347-116507" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
        <div>
          <head n="2" source="#source-116368-116503"><seg source="#source-116368-116380">オランダ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-116380-116392"><rb>語</rb><rt>ご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-116392-116395">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-116395-116419"><rb>先生</rb><rt>せんせい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-116419-116434">となったが</seg></head>
        </div>
